WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:04,380
The girls competed in the finals of the Mechanical Iron Fish Flying World Mecha Competition

2
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,650
There is a super black who eliminated the snake earth god

3
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:09,370
Play against the biggest favorite in the world for multiple championships

4
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:15,780
Tianhan Zhao Yunchuyao from the Federal Academy of Sciences

5
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,460
I'm here just to see you

6
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,780
Verify that your mecha is not as good as mine

7
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:22,540
I don’t need to do it myself to hit you.

8
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,780
I'm only responsible for telling you

9
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:24,940
Where did you lose?

10
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,020
It’s clear to change your head

11
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,260
I haven't seen this kind of armor before

12
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,580
Thousand Faces of the Water Moon

13
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:30,500
Not even a cockpit

14
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,700
And also learn independently

15
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,340
All combat data of the opponent

16
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,300
This is a fully automatic combat mecha

17
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:37,130
are you ready

18
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:38,410
Just a reminder

19
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:40,970
Thousand Faces of Water Moon will learn every move you make

20
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:42,090
the more you hit

21
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:44,550
It gets stronger, right?

22
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:49,750
Then why not open Yongchun?

23
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:54,750
Centralize power and you will do it.

24
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:56,230
I can do it

25
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:58,270
All the numbers you have used before

26
00:00:58,270 --> 00:01:00,070
Remember all the faces on the water

27
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:08,280
From the beginning to now

28
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:10,360
Feed every move to the AI

29
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:17,310
Every move was drained by blood

30
00:01:17,310 --> 00:01:19,270
Your shadow mode is really awesome

31
00:01:19,270 --> 00:01:21,110
Plus your god-like fighting skills

32
00:01:21,110 --> 00:01:23,310
But it does not represent your mecha manufacturing level

33
00:01:23,310 --> 00:01:24,310
can surpass me

34
00:01:24,350 --> 00:01:26,870
You will definitely lose. You are right.

35
00:01:26,870 --> 00:01:28,910
Shadow mode can only copy my Ge Dou number

36
00:01:28,910 --> 00:01:30,750
But wait and see what happens next

37
00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:48,730
You switch back to Nass Armor

38
00:01:48,730 --> 00:01:51,570
He's been fighting everyone with half a mecha
